==Transportation==
[[File:Smoke Dungeon dust devils.png|thumb|left|The dust devil area.]]
*[[Teleport to House]] (if house is in Pollnivneach)
*[[Scroll of redirection]] on a [[Teleport to house (tablet)]] for a [[Pollnivneach teleport]]
*Using a [[Nardah teleport]] and then taking a [[magic carpet]] to [[Pollnivneach]]<ref name="n">The carpet costs 200 coins to use, reduced to 100 coins after doing the [[Rogue Trader]] [[miniquest]]. With a [[Ring of Charos(a)]], the price is further reduced to 75 coins. If the Ring of Charos(a) is used without completing [[The Feud]] [[quest]], the price is 100 coins. If the [[Hard Desert Diary]] is complete, all magic carpet rides are free of charge.</ref>
*Using a [[desert amulet 2]] or higher and then taking a magic carpet to Pollnivneach<ref name="n" />
*From [[Al Kharid]], go through the [[Shantay Pass]] and take a magic carpet to Pollnivneach
*Teleport to the [[Jaldraocht Pyramid]] with the [[Pharaoh's sceptre]], then running north-east.
*Fairy Ring {{Fairycode|DLQ}} will take you North of Nardah
